[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775380259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2775380259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2775380259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lbPEj","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T10:59:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T11:00:28Z","body":"Simply removing the `clear()` will make the filter take effect when invisible, which can be confusing when you open a FileDialog and see no files, because of some hidden text field.\r\nYou can use `_validate_property()` to hide the property conditionally when the filter is disabled.\r\n\r\nAlthough I wonder why is the filter even exposed as a property?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775380259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776308780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2776308780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2776308780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lexws","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T16:14:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T16:15:39Z","body":"Hello, that was something I was unfortunately un-able to figure out; how to make the filter clear itself when the box is not visible. It seems that something is horribly wrong in the back-end, or I'm really looking at it wrong. Either way, I'm not sure how to proceed, and I'm open to ideas.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean by :\r\n> You can use _validate_property() to hide the property conditionally when the filter is disabled.\r\n> Although I wonder why is the filter even exposed as a property?\r\n\r\nApologies.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776308780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776621628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2776621628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2776621628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lf-I8","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T18:35:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T18:35:14Z","body":"Ok I looked at FileDialog again (sorry, I wasn't familiar with `filename_filter` property) and the visibility of the filter is not exposed.\r\nIf there was a property for filter field visibility, you could hide the property from the inspector, but in the current state it's not possible.\r\n\r\nI think `filename_filter` should've never been exposed as a property, because it doesn't make sense. What you can do for now is clear the `filename_filter` in `set_show_filename_filter()` method, when the filter box is supposed to appear. This, or make the filter ignored when hidden.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776621628/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777537411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2777537411","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2777537411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ljduD","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T04:37:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T04:37:59Z","body":"Hey.\nConsidering the existence of another array of filters, literally called `filters`, I'm not sure why `filename_filter` exists, because in theory the user can just put their required filter in the `filters` property. I've never done this, because according to the documentation, `filters` is for *file extension* filters and the other is for *file name* filters. But that's not the scope of this PR; to determine whether or not this property is required. I guess in a way it is, because native file dialogs (Like GTKs file dialog) will never respond to the file name being filtered but will always respond to the extensions being filtered.\n \nThose are good compromises/solutions. I'll give those a try and see which one is easier.\n\nThanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777537411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2778143014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2778143014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2778143014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6llxkm","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T09:52:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T09:52:56Z","body":"> But that's not the scope of this PR; to determine whether or not this property is required.\r\n\r\nYes, that should've been discussed in the original PR. Now it's too late .-.\r\nThe problem with this property is that it mimics the input field that user has control over. It's completely redundant. At most you can use it as \"default search text\", but idk why would you do that.\r\n\r\n`filters` is part of dialog's configuration that customize it's behavior.\r\nIt doesn't help that the two have similar names, so it can be confusing 😅","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2778143014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781464392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2781464392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2781464392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lycdI","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-06T14:58:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-06T14:58:54Z","body":"Apologies if that was a joke that I did not get, but what PR are you talking about?\n\nThere could be uses for a \"default search text\". I've used this property myself in my (now defunct) M3U editor. When clicking the name of an artist, a file dialog opens with the default search text (filename_filter) being the text of the artist name. Same applies to the song title. Admittedly later on I switched to using native dialogs. \n\nIf it's intended to be used as a default search text, it could be renamed to something like `search_query` (Considering the property changes while the user is playing the game, calling it `default_search_query` would be incorrect.)\n\nWhat do you suggest I do? Patch the bug or completely remove this property?\n\nEDIT: When I say patch the bug, I'll find a new solution to the filename_filter not resetting properly when the box is hidden.\nThanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781464392/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781482800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2781482800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2781482800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lyg8w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-06T15:42:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-06T15:42:00Z","body":"> what PR are you talking about?\r\n\r\nI meant the implementation pull request (#88673). It's fairly recent, but it was merged in 4.4, so removing or renaming the property is not possible (it would break compatibility).\r\n\r\nThough if you say that default search text has some use then fine.\r\n\r\nI came up with another solution. My problem with the current one is that it can result in the dialog filtering entries with invisible filter. It can be solved by making the filter field automatically appear when `filename_filter` is not empty.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781482800/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781981897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2781981897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2781981897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l0azJ","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T04:23:06Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T04:23:06Z","body":"It's a niche use indeed, but I feel it's still important to keep this property. It's not like we can remove it anyway.\n\nI'll take a look at that PR and see what I can gather about the current implementation.\n\nI'll also try all the solutions we've discussed and see which one works out the best. I didn't have much time recently but hopefully I will in this week.\n\nThanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781981897/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2792519636","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2792519636","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2792519636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mcnfU","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T12:05:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T12:05:32Z","body":"Hello, just a status update.\r\nI'll be out of town between 11th April and 25th April. I probably will not be able to work on this in between this period. Apologies.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2792519636/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2834785374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104492#issuecomment-2834785374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104492","id":2834785374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o92Re","user":{"login":"WinnerWind","id":71366717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzY2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71366717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind","html_url":"https://github.com/WinnerWind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WinnerWind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Winn